'''Nyamusu''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained from the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 262
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nyamusu
|name2 = Neko Nyamusu
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Neko Nyamusu '''at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Nyamusu is mainly a medium range attacker, with good stats for her cost. Although the lack of + levels prevents her to be on par with certain other Rare Cats, she can still be used as an extra, to aid other damage dealers on the field. Not to mention that, due to availability, this unit can be really strong early on.

To make use of her freeze ability for Red enemies, mass-summon meatshields to protect her, like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or the [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cats]]. Even though [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], who has a guaranteed freeze, exists, Nyamusu's range advantage and individual stackability make her useful in [[Legend Stages#Crown Difficulty|4 Crown]] Stories of Legend as a replacement.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

